WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.217
Welcome to Module 12.

00:00:02.217 --> 00:00:11.042
Before we trust an analysis or build a model, we need to understand the quality of the data going into it.

00:00:11.042 --> 00:00:17.932
Cleaning and exploratory data analysis help us find missing values, duplicates, incorrect types,

00:00:17.932 --> 00:00:23.174
inconsistent categories, unusual values, and basic patterns.

00:00:23.901 --> 00:00:26.633
The goal is not to make data look perfect.

00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:34.031
The goal is to understand what is present, what is questionable, and what decisions we are making before analysis.
